      "statement": "A user account is the UserDurableObject addressed by idFromName(normalized-username-or-verified-email): usernames are lowercased with a strict charset before DO addressing, and every SSO path (Access, gatekeeper login) keys the same way, so identity resolution is one DO id rule.",
