      "id": "claim_a0216ca42d074e889f1e9a243fdd6863",
      "statement": "Password authentication never sends the password: the client computes argon2id with salt SERVICE_SALT+utf8(username) at 64 MiB/3 iterations as specified on the login() contract, keeping the server blind to the secret and the expensive hash on the client.",
